# --- artefacts of running the test suites from the repository root ---
# `go build ./cmd/venom` without -o drops the binary here; tests/db_fixtures.yml declares
# `dsn: "memory"`, which makes the sqlite driver create a database file of that name in the
# working directory. Neither belongs in the repository, and this one publishes one-way to a
# public mirror (scripts/publish-github.sh).
/venom
/memory

